#3700
Zone Notes: The Midgaard Underworks~
The Midgaard Underworks, Zone 37. Builder pass: kokudar, preserving
Welcor's original topology. Player level range: 3-7. This is the upper
civic drainage layer beneath Midgaard. The area now emphasizes working
sluices, rat warrens, bat quarantine galleries, abandoned maintenance
spaces, a smuggler cache, and the underground reservoir. The descent at
3717 remains the handoff into Zone 38, which should become the older and
more dangerous lower underworks.
~
37 513 0 0 0 0
S
#3701
The Main Sluice Junction~
Three brick-lined drains meet beneath a low vaulted ceiling blackened by
generations of lamp smoke. Brown runoff slides through shallow channels
cut into the floor while iron rings, old chalk marks, and a cracked
inspection plaque show that city workers once maintained this place
regularly. Rat tracks cross the damp silt in every direction. The
northern collector carries water deeper below Midgaard, while older
conduits branch east and west.
~
