#3702
Beneath the City Drain~
The broad drainpipe slopes down from somewhere above the city and
empties into ankle-deep runoff. Every sound from the streets is reduced
to a distant murmur through layers of stone. A rusted ladder bracket and
worn boot scrapes show where maintenance crews once descended, but the
place now belongs to insects, rats, and whatever survives on what
Midgaard throws away. The main junction lies north.
~
