#3705
The Gnawing Run~
This length of conduit has been claimed by the rat colony. Old wooden
braces are chewed almost smooth, scraps of cloth have been pulled into
wall cracks, and tiny bones lie between the bricks. The passage opens
into a damaged junction to the north. Behind you, the cleaner geometry
of the city sewer feels surprisingly civilized.
