#3708
The Rusted Quarantine Grate~
A heavy iron grate divides the conduit here. Its bars are furred with
rust, old grease, and dried sludge, and a faded municipal stamp can
still be made out beneath the grime. Beyond it lies a section of sewer
long abandoned to the rat colony. The city clearly meant this barrier to
stay shut, though time has done as much damage to it as any intruder.
~
