#3713
The Packed-Earth Crawl~
This cramped burrow twists through soil beneath the city foundations.
Smooth fur-polished walls show that hundreds of animals use it each day.
Roots hang from the ceiling like thin fingers, and every few yards a
side hole disappears into darkness. The tunnel is large enough for a
person only because the colony's largest rats have made it so.
