@RThe Court of Gristlefang@W@n~
The deepest nest has become a grotesque little court. A mound of torn
bedding, stolen purses, bent cutlery, bones, buttons, and bright
fragments rises against the far wall. Smaller rats keep to the edges,
leaving the center clear for Gristlefang, the immense scarred beast that
rules this warren. Nothing here suggests human intelligence, but the
arrangement of tribute around the nest is uncomfortably close to ritual.
