#3717
@CThe Deepworks Drop@W@n~
The collector ends at a circular shaft where the floor falls away around
an iron ladder. Water spills over the rim and vanishes into darkness
twenty feet below. Old maintenance marks warn of deeper flood channels,
unstable masonry, and sealed works beneath this level. The ladder
descends toward the older underworks of Zone 38, where Midgaard's newer
sewers were built over structures nobody now maintains.
