#3745
The Underworks Service Path~
A gravel service path follows the low foothills outside Midgaard. Rusted
survey stakes and half-buried drainage stones show that the route once
belonged to municipal workers. The sewer vent lies east among the rocks.
Southward, the path approaches an abandoned spur where an older road
connection has collapsed.
~
