#3746
The Collapsed Highway Spur~
The service path ends at a broken embankment. A landslip has carried
away the old southern connection, leaving cracked paving stones and a
view toward the distant western highway below. The route is no longer
passable from here. Northward, the gravel path returns toward the
forgotten sewer vent.
~
